                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"> </p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">For decades, Roadlab has served clients in the Eastern Cape from our Mthatha and East London branches</p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><span>Today, clients operating in and around Queenstown have even greater access to Roadlab's expert material testing and laboratory services.</span></p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><span>Magrietta, Pieter and Mike have been operating our latest branch the country in Queenstown since September 2021.</span></p>\n<p>Got questions? You can reach our Queenstown branch at 082 415 8808 or by leaving an enquiry below.</p>",
                  "editor": {
